# --- Firmware secrets (MQTT passwords, WiFi passwords) ---
# Each Arduino/MicroPython project has a `secrets.h.template` (committed)
# and a local `secrets.h` / `secrets.py` (NEVER committed). Copy template
# to the real file and fill in values before flashing.
#
# This is a PUBLIC repo — real secrets must NEVER be tracked.
**/secrets.h
**/secrets.py

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea
.vscode/
*.swp

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# --- Arduino IDE build artifacts ---
build/
*.elf
*.bin
*.map
